===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|rücke}}, from {{inh|de|goh|rucki}}, akin to {{cog|osx|hruggi}}, both from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*hrugi}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*hrugjaz}}. More at {{m|en|ridge}}.

